$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~14 min | Difficulty: Hard]] A Cylon fuel depot, a captured tanker and two Movers, feeds a dozen raiding wings. The Nightjars burn it. A basestar will jump in minutes after the first kill. Do not be there.", -1)
$end_multi_text

